// Billing accounts and the projects they pay for, payment methods, cost and
// usage, spend limits and the price list.
//
// A billing account is an organization's: it holds the profile invoices are
// issued to and the payment method its usage is charged to. Every project is
// linked to exactly one of its organization's billing accounts, and its usage
// is charged there. An organization starts with one, its default account.
//
// Access to billing accounts is granted separately from access to projects:
// an organization's owner doesn't hold it by default. Only an organization's
